In this PR, I have added a formate validation for condition message; 
Examples of condition message -- "my_name", "MY_NAME", "MyName"


I have also  introduced three tags to reason message.

staging/src/k8s.io/api/storage/v1/types.go

```
	// +k8s:alpha(since: "1.38")=+k8s:maxBytes=256
	// +k8s:alpha(since: "1.38")=+k8s:format=k8s-condition-reason
	// Maximum permitted length of a reason is 256 characters.
	Reason string `json:"reason" protobuf:"bytes,2,opt,name=reason"`
```
